## 🏗️ FILES TO BUILD (in order)

### STEP 1 — stream-icons.jsx (update with image imports)
**File:** `src/pages/stream-icons.jsx`
- Import each PNG icon by slug
- Export `<StreamPortalIcon slug={} />` — renders the PNG with glow animation

### STEP 2 — StudentMissionPage.jsx (full gaming redesign)
**File:** `src/pages/StudentMissionPage.jsx`
- StreamPicker → **Portal cards** each with `<video>` loop + PNG poster
- LevelStep → **World-map path nodes** using level-locked/available/complete PNGs
- ReadyPanel → **Countdown 3→2→1** animation + floating stream icon
- NEW: **StudentGameResultsPage** component (victory/gameover screen)

### STEP 3 — student-mission.css (already written ✅, needs video-bg rule added)

### STEP 4 — StudentGamePage.jsx (add HUD chrome)
**File:** `src/pages/StudentGamePage.jsx`
- Add top HUD bar: `[StreamIcon] [LevelName] [Timer ⏱️] [Hearts ❤️❤️❤️] [Score 🏆]`
- Add `<video>` background loop per stream (game-hud-bg.mp4)
- Slide-in animation between questions

### STEP 5 — student-game.css (add HUD + video bg styles)

### STEP 6 — LeaderboardPage.jsx (animation upgrades)
- Crown 👑 on rank #1 entry
- Score counter tick-up animation
- Slide-in for new entries
- Live dot pulse animation

### STEP 7 — AdminActivityPreviewModal.jsx (proper implementation)
- Glassmorphic dark modal overlay
- Shows question prompt + activity type + metadata badges

